{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Stop taxing UK citizens on the state pension",
        "additional_details": "They have worked throughout their lives & paid tax on their earnings, to then be taxed again is abhorrent.",
        "background": "British citizens who have, though out their working life, paid National Insurance & tax, should not then be taxed on the state pension regardless of other earning/pensions.",
